    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "844d0094167a6d19e6a383877892b43747bf84c8a81b4582071c89072dea5be8",
      "target": "> Toolformer（Schick 等，2023）开创了自监督工具调用标注。Berkeley 函数调用排行榜（Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard，BFCL）V4（Patil 等，2025）确立了 2026 年的标准：评分权重为 40% 智能体类（agentic）、30% 多轮类（multi-turn）、10% Live（真实用户提示词类）、10% Non-Live（合成测试用例类）、10% 幻觉类（hallucination）。单轮问题已经解决。记忆、动态决策和长时程工具调用链则尚未解决。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "8aeefd870e61afed6fdaff39d1c740c60d95ad5219c7e4ce7bd49f5d4e815248",
      "target": "**Type:** Build\n**Languages:** Python (stdlib)\n**Prerequisites:** 阶段 14 · 01（智能体循环），阶段 13 · 01（函数调用深入解析）\n**Time:** ~60 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
