    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "2794c50b8b5049af8f67f406c278824f25e98e7ff8e3b421187c0c0d7c31fd94",
      "target": "- 解释 Toolformer 的自监督训练信号：只有执行工具后能降低下一 token（词元）预测损失，才保留工具调用标注。\n- 列出 BFCL V4 的五类评测及各自衡量的内容。\n- 用标准库实现一个工具注册表（tool registry），支持 schema（结构定义）校验、参数类型转换和执行沙箱隔离（sandboxing）。\n- 分析 2026 年三个尚未解决的问题：长时程工具调用链、动态决策和记忆。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "d6a1d32e3c35ebb1a4f985c776919c42017915694286946b6fdacaedbedefe78",
      "target": "早期的工具使用关注：模型能否预测出正确的函数调用（function calling）？现代工具使用关注：模型能否在具备记忆、只能观测到部分环境信息的情况下，连续衔接工具执行 40 步，从工具故障中恢复，同时不臆造并不存在的工具？\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "e41a3bcf78bb60b709362a964cbc9b34ef1507781d9828714c7f7922c5512d1b",
      "target": "Toolformer 奠定了基线：模型可以通过自监督学习何时调用工具。BFCL V4 定义了 2026 年的评测目标。生产环境中的智能体（agent）所要应对的，正是两者之间的差距。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
