    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "5c7516f01a54340ffe1eb1d245137689b99299b7c3ba76382419781d363dc9f3",
      "target": "### Toolformer（Schick 等，NeurIPS 2023）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "7a290951607d6b457497972faf4a40613c41149a160053dc83b5c8f699f362c7",
      "target": "思路：让模型在自己的预训练语料库中标注候选 API（应用程序编程接口）调用。逐一执行这些候选调用。只有在加入工具结果后，下一 token 的预测损失降低，才保留该标注。随后在筛选后的语料库上进行微调（fine-tuning）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "11caeb6915e280963936c1c1c99c8e7a292a533e8e132a2603a45c03a4e6f0fc",
      "target": "涵盖的工具：计算器、问答（QA）系统、搜索引擎、翻译器和日历。自监督信号只关心工具是否有助于预测文本，不使用人工标签。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "4e2ed1935ab2fdf453cd4aa77bee0252e86240533d195e8ad4ffee466a608d56",
      "target": "关于规模的结果：工具使用能力会随着规模增大而涌现。工具调用标注会损害较小模型的表现，却能让较大模型受益。这就是为什么 2026 年的前沿模型内置了较强的工具使用能力，而大多数 7B 模型需要专门进行工具使用微调才能可靠工作。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Toolformer (Schick et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "0771a8c94102e8a3407ad46b36eed8a90388b7755cb3f09e5f5d6664f28cc43d",
      "target": "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4（Patil 等，ICML 2025）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "c2a23e49f61f55947ef12f041436d975233bfc1cb66c513e686c2b04bb5f5ccd",
      "target": "BFCL 是 2026 年事实上的评测标准。V4 的评分权重构成如下：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0031",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "e9997b80ee8d72f798f02bf1720da6d78f4c69f8b675c0eadd362190127d20e0",
      "target": "- **智能体类（Agentic，40%）** — 完整的智能体轨迹：记忆、多轮交互、动态决策。\n- **多轮类（Multi-Turn，30%）** — 包含工具调用链的交互式对话。\n- **Live（10%）** — 用户提交的真实提示词（prompt），其分布更难应对。\n- **Non-Live（10%）** — 合成测试用例。\n- **幻觉类（Hallucination，10%）** — 检测何时不应调用任何工具。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "1a977ab3b90a09cf2b745d1191c9fd6ee0c0506396bb5e3bb6cb230780390076",
      "target": "V3 引入了基于状态的评测：执行一串工具调用后，检查 API 的实际状态（例如“文件是否已创建？”），而不是匹配工具调用的抽象语法树（AST）。V4 新增了网页搜索、记忆和格式敏感性类别。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard V4 (Patil et al., ICML 2025)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "c7131a590db93647f48640baa257d2cb1a469ca9de5567f830fd4484da79f595",
      "target": "2026 年的关键发现：单轮函数调用已接近解决。失败集中在记忆（跨轮次携带上下文）、动态决策（根据先前结果选择工具）、长时程调用链（经过 20+ 步后发生漂移）和幻觉检测（没有合适工具时拒绝调用）上。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
