      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "1a9cf4e23c6ba49158a8355b6217d900ae18f77363a0ae717dfa36b9c1ad727a",
      "target": "```text\nname: string\ndescription: string (what it does, when to use it)\ninput_schema: JSON Schema (properties, required, types, enums)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Tool schema"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Tool schema"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "962e60ea2c5551173c1a6d9c3c0248fc3b345a40ef053f519f628ddeae2d4b34",
      "target": "Anthropic 直接使用 `input_schema`。OpenAI 使用 `function.parameters`。两者都接受 JSON Schema。描述起着关键作用：模型会阅读描述来选择正确的工具。糟糕的工具描述是选错工具这一类失败的首要（#1）根因。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Tool schema"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "9e2ea00979d7e564479761e12dda44b4cf4105138da29e11c9350a03060c2e52",
      "target": "### 实参校验\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "681e3e295869ac77adfbaa9459e0746c6c9bfb26f6b94fe6ae3de3b9e4ac5779",
      "target": "不要信任任何工具调用。需要校验：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0048",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0049",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "c751c2794416ae419e4469ad074efe84b1cf3a0a082511162f97c6b302f1133a",
      "target": "1. **类型强制转换。** schema 要求 int 时，模型可能返回字符串 \"5\"。含义明确时进行转换；有歧义时则拒绝。\n2. **枚举值校验。** 如果 schema 声明 `status in {\"open\", \"closed\"}`，模型却输出 `\"in_progress\"`，就拒绝该调用，并返回说明原因的错误。\n3. **必填字段。** 缺少必填字段 -> 立即向模型返回错误观察结果，而不是让程序崩溃。\n4. **格式校验。** 日期、电子邮件地址、URL：使用相应的解析器校验，而不是正则表达式。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0050",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "48877694842a855db3ae1fbefdacdb9f31ae5d3e245ac4bafe1d7013dd6bafb3",
      "target": "每次校验失败都应返回结构化观察结果，让模型能够以正确的结构重试。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Argument validation"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "3040884b2bb2df86b273b8e75ce3a4612c1e5c315538e15fb0b034e269e93ac9",
      "target": "### 并行工具调用\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "6a44bb57f6f365fbbd29eedf5f368328cba4108dd27c624363c53583ba5e61f6",
      "target": "现代提供商支持在一个助手轮次中发出并行工具调用。循环过程如下：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0057",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "ab3bb0b4314d93cb365a528f0ae7f5ec30b278968dbb7eb51e2c8e7855a14c55",
      "target": "1. 模型发出 3 个工具调用，各自带有不同的 `tool_use_id`。\n2. 运行时（runtime）执行这些调用；如果它们相互独立，就并行执行。\n3. 每个结果都以 `tool_result` 块的形式返回，并通过 `tool_use_id` 关联到对应调用。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "efb41445eec414dc823a9baafe2d1eaf75d16821f1cc137566347aac07f2d906",
      "target": "工程规则：关联 ID（correlation ID）至关重要。把它们弄反，就会将工具调用与错误的结果配对。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0060",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Parallel tool calls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sandboxing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "8f910a1d522f4a37a02ff36fecc89312d985b56a69c594b0b22e19e037532ce2",
      "target": "### 沙箱隔离\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0062",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sandboxing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sandboxing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "8bcfd38a41e9ce346a68bdaf9298b223d2c3420dee037d5ee0c91c7076fc91ff",
      "target": "工具执行是沙箱边界。详见第 09 课。简而言之，每个工具都应指定读写访问范围、网络访问、超时限制和内存上限。通用的 `run_shell(cmd)` 是危险信号；用途明确的 `git_status()` 更安全。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0064",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sandboxing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0065",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sandboxing"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "f73b86a37257de8cba59bf37ad82c07116797b5cb36f6f046d12a0930f48fad8",
      "target": "```figure\ntool-routing\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0066",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Sandboxing"
