        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0071",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "8a87fa3db9cdffc916e5186385edd238c4e6f1d1dfe87328a209f9a1327acced",
      "target": "- JSON Schema 子集校验器，仅使用标准库。\n- 工具注册信息包含描述、输入 schema、超时限制和执行器。\n- 参数类型转换与枚举值校验。\n- 带有关联 ID 的并行工具分派。\n- 以结构化字符串形式返回的错误观察结果。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-06:b0072",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Tool Use and Function Calling",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
